      "description": "Kafka records between partition end offsets and committed consumer offsets, summed per topic and group. An uncommitted offset (-1) is treated as zero. Values are record counts, not seconds. Zero lag does not confirm API freshness or completeness of upstream delivery. ClickHouseConsumerLag fires when group/topic lag stays above zero for 30 seconds.",
